Revoke a recorded producer grant so emissions fail closed

Usage:
  eshu component revoke-grant <producer-id> [flags]

Flags:
      --component-home string   Component registry home directory
  -h, --help                    help for revoke-grant
      --json                    Write stable JSON output
      --kind string             Core-owned fact kind to revoke
      --scope string            Source scope to revoke
      --version string          Granted manifest version to revoke

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
